      {
        "number": 14,
        "internalPageId": null,
        "title": "We are lost, right? So, We are lost, Annie! No, we are not, Nathan. See¡ we are on Maple Street. And? We are supposed to be on K-Street at the museum. Well, we are close, look! We need to walk two blocks and go along the park. And then? Is the museum across the park? No! we get out of the park and go left for one block and we get to K-Street. But are you sure? I don’t want to get lost. Don’t worry! The museum is on the first right corner of K-Street. Ok, let’s go.",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "We are lost, right? So, We are lost, Annie! No, we are not, Nathan. See¡ we are on Maple Street. And? We are supposed to be on K-Street at the museum. Well, we are close, look! We need to walk two blocks and go along the park. And then? Is the museum across the park? No! we get out of the park and go left for one block and we get to K-Street. But are you sure? I don’t want to get lost. Don’t worry! The museum is on the first right corner of K-Street. Ok, let’s go.",
          "C. Read the following dialogue and state if the sentences are true (T) or false (F). After that, read the dialogue aloud with your teacher.",
          "1. They are on the main avenue. (T) (F) 2. They need to be on K-Street. (T) (F) 3. They need to go to the local market. (T) (F) 4. They have to walk three blocks. (T) (F)",
          "5. They have to go along the park. (T) (F) 6. They have to go left when they get out of the park. (T) (F) 7. Annie is not sure about the information. (T) (F) 8. The museum is on the first right corner of K-Street. (T) (F)"
        ],
